<title>USA: U.S. Plastic Lumber acquires three cos.</title>
<headline>U.S. Plastic Lumber acquires three cos.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Plastic Lumber Corp said Tuesday it acquired  Custom Pac Extrusions Inc, Environmental Specialty Products Inc and  Advanced Remediation and Disposal Technologies Inc for an undisclosed amount of cash and stock.</p>
<p>The company said its acquisitions had about $5 million in combined sales in 1996.</p>
